hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"15593","Yahya ibn Said informed us: al-Mushmaill narrated to us, he said: Amr ibn Sulaym al-Muzani narrated to me, he said: I heard Rafi ibn Amr al-Muzani, he said: I heard the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him), while I was a servant boy, saying: Ajwah and the tree are of Paradise."
